@crew v-grimaldi-iver
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello hello! Iver Grimaldi. Seeds, soil, and a lot of talking.
- Morning! Have you met the tomatoes yet? They're shy. Mostly.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! The tomatoes asked after you. Well. I asked for them.   #funny
?

== chat
- I talk to the tomatoes. Tove talks to the beans. We've agreed not to compete.   #funny
- Up at five. Best hour. The plants are fresh and nobody's queueing for toast.

== near
? place:hydroponics_garden
- Good morning, row three. Lovely colour today. Keep it up.   #funny
? place:crew_store
- The store sells string. Good string. I've bought far too much.   #funny
?

== bye
- {bye}! If a tomato says anything, write it down.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Come on, row three. You can do it.   #funny
- Lovely soil. Lovely.
